{"3746560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ethernia", "steam_appid": 3746560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746560/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker_2.gif?t=1778184917\" /></span><strong><br><br>Welcome to Ethernia</strong>, a free 2D MMORPG with pixel art, real-time combat, gathering, crafting, and an engaging narrative inspired by an ancient lost book.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌍 Open World Full of Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique regions, face legendary creatures, and unlock ancient powers while interacting with other players in real time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧙‍♀️ <strong>Choose Your Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your character, customize attributes and specializations, participate in PvE and PvP events, gather resources, and evolve your build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📜 <strong>Quests, Exploration, and Progression System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the very first steps, you'll be part of a living story—filled with quests, daily challenges, bosses, and decisions that shape your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ <strong>Highlights:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantasy pixel art MMORPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE, PvP, and class-based progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gathering, mining, and crafting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active combat with skills and strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative with multiple branches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely free to play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prepare to immerse yourself in our universe, where each player is a living page of history and discover if you are the Heir of Ethernia.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746560/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker_3.gif?t=1778184917\" /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746560/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker_2.gif?t=1778184917\" /></span><strong><br><br>Welcome to Ethernia</strong>, a free 2D MMORPG with pixel art, real-time combat, gathering, crafting, and an engaging narrative inspired by an ancient lost book.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌍 Open World Full of Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique regions, face legendary creatures, and unlock ancient powers while interacting with other players in real time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧙‍♀️ <strong>Choose Your Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your character, customize attributes and specializations, participate in PvE and PvP events, gather resources, and evolve your build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📜 <strong>Quests, Exploration, and Progression System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the very first steps, you'll be part of a living story—filled with quests, daily challenges, bosses, and decisions that shape your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ <strong>Highlights:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantasy pixel art MMORPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE, PvP, and class-based progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gathering, mining, and crafting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active combat with skills and strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative with multiple branches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely free to play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prepare to immerse yourself in our universe, where each player is a living page of history and discover if you